At 2nd level, you know two Blood Rites of your choice from
the list at the end of this class. When you reach certain Blood
Hunter levels you learn more Rites of your choice, as shown
in the Rites Known column of the Blood Hunter class table.
Once you invoke a Blood Rite you must finish a short or
long rest before you can invoke that Blood Rite again. When
you have no uses of a Blood Rite remaining, you can make a
Vital Sacrifice (detailed below) to use that Rite again.
Blood Rites can only be used against creatures with blood.
However, when you make a Vital Sacrifice to empower a Rite,
you can target any creature, regardless if it has blood or not.

